  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A working group within the Ministry of Finance has been appointed. Their task is to simplify the reporting system and to develop regulations to state and local government agencies regarding the annual report 99 and IT-solutions. Financing of salaries for 14 members of the workinggroup and one accounting expert and IT-experts.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En internarbetsgrupp har uppr&#xE4;ttats f&#xF6;r tillf&#xE4;llig l&#xF6;sning f&#xF6;r ett bokslut f&#xF6;r estniska staten f&#xF6;r 1999 och rutiner f&#xF6;r bokslut 2000 inom riksredovisningsprojektet Estland. Insatsen g&#xE4;ller finansiering av lokala l&#xF6;ner vid genomf&#xF6;rande av en tempor&#xE4;r l&#xF6;sning f&#xF6;r 1999 och 2000-&#xE5;rs riskbokslut.</narrative>
  </description>
